DIRECTORY - test
================

High level test scripts
-----------------------

crosstalkX
crosstalkX.asm
crosstalkXNolog
crosstalkXSim
crosstalkXSimNolog
crosstalkY
crosstalkY.asm
crosstalkYNolog
crosstalkYSim
crosstalkYSimNolog
crosstalkZ
crosstalkZ.asm
crosstalkZNolog
crosstalkZSim
crosstalkZSimNolog
        Various detector translation cross talk calibration scripts.

dumpFits
        Extract information from the GMOS Status Alarm Database and
        save it as a file looking like a FITS header. This script
        simulates the action of the OCS when it collects static
        header information.

flexLog
flexLog_old
flexLog_sciOnly
        Flexure test scripts.

focusLog
focusLogSim
        Focus test scripts
        (real and simulation mode versions).

gratingJuggle
        Grating repeatability test script.

hartAB
hartABCD
hartCD
hartFocusRun
        Hartmann focus test scripts.

logFilterSwitches
logFilterSwitchesSim
        Log the position of the filter in-position switches
        (real and simulation mode versions).

logImages
logImagesSim
        Instrument stability test - log a series of images
        (real and simulation mode versions).

logTemps
logTempsSim
        Temperature calibration test script
        (real and simulation mode versions).

turretSimUpdate
turretSimUpdateCP
        Soak test the grating turret, simulating a realistic
        series of UPDATE commands (MK and CP versions).

wfsImageLog
        Wavefront sensor stability check - log a series of images.


Low level utilities
-------------------

assemblyReset
        Reset an assembly to make it look as if it has just
        been booted. This is useful to save rebooting the
        VME crate when testing a checkout script.

checkout
        This sets the environment variables, sets up logging files
        and runs the *Checkout.scr script.

checkoutCP
        Same as checkout except uses CP configFiles and sim luts

checkoutSim
        Same as checkout except uses sim configFiles and sim luts

deviceReset
        Reset a device to make it look as if it has just
        been booted. This is useful to save rebooting the
        VME crate when testing a checkout script.

gmosCheckout
        Run various levels of checkout on the entire GMOS instrument.

gmosCheckoutSim
        Same as gmosCheckout but uses simulation database.

purgeLogs
        Remove old log files, prompting before removing any.

purgeSmallLogs
        Remove small log files, prompting before removing any.
        (Such small files are normally created when a script
        fails to start).

runMaskErrTests
        Runs cassetteErrCheckout and extractorErrCheckout scripts.

runMaskTests
        Runs gripCheckout, releaseCheckout, extractorCheckout and
        cassetteCheckout scripts.

setDevicePrefixes
        Define environment variables containing the assembly and device
        prefixes used in the GMOS EPICS database.

gmosSetResetAliases
        Define some useful aliases for executing the assemblyReset
        and deviceReset scripts with common combinations of
        arguments.

soak
        This sets the environment variables and runs a checkout test
        over and over again to check the reliability of a component.

soakSim
        Same as soak but uses simulation database.


CAU utilities
-------------

monitor_activeC.cau
monitor_apply.cau
monitor_datum.cau
monitor_debug.cau
