        - Set mask DBUG to FULL
        - Set optoSensorDelay to 0 then Park at position two again
        - Set optoSensorDelay to 1 then Park at position two again
        - Set optoSensorDelay to 2 then Park at position two again
        - Set optoSensorDelay to 3 then Park at position two again
        - Set optoSensorDelay to 4 then Park at position two again
